# Only ops/ (code, templates, patches) and .env.example go into the image; never keys, private config,
# run data, mappings, logs, caches or the host's upstream checkout.
*
!ops/
!.env.example
ops/config/llm.yaml
ops/config/limits.yaml
ops/config/prices.yaml
ops/config/zep_limits.yaml
ops/config/sensitive_terms.txt
ops/state/
ops/runs/
ops/logs/
ops/mappings/
ops/cache/
**/__pycache__/
